('alict_02507', 6, 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', 'Consider the following Python number'''''' B. number'' C. b = y = "AL", 2024 D. d = 4, 5, ''AL Student'' E. a = b = c = d = ("ICT", "FROMABC") Which of the above Python statements is', '["A only", "B only", "C and E only", "All of the above", "None of the above. A B C E"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "C and E only". Trace through the code line by line (variable assignments, loop iterations, and function calls) to confirm this result.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Programming Concepts (Python/PHP)', NULL, 2507, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
