('alict_02601', 8, 'Web Development', 'Which of the following best describes an external hyperlink?', '["A link to a section within the same page", "A link to another page within the same site", "A link to a page on a different website", "A link to a multimedia object within the same site", "A link to download files"]'::jsonb, 3, 'Correct answer: "A link to a page on a different website". This follows from standard HTML/CSS behaviour for the tag or property in question.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Web Development', NULL, 2601, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
