('alict_02603', 8, 'Web Development', 'What does the <style> tag in signify in terms of CSS?', '["It embeds CSS styles directly within an document. th", "It links an external CSS file to the document. th", "It defines an inline CSS rule for a single element. th", "It enables to manipulate CSS properties. th yg CSS yelshdj ,nd", "It creates a default style sheet for the browser. th"]'::jsonb, 1, 'The means that the CSS rules written inside the document. It is typically placed within the used in the fuhska woyia lrkafka The correct answer is option 1), It embeds CSS styles directly within an document', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Web Development', NULL, 2603, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02604', 8, 'Web Development', 'Which of the following is a valid use case for CSS but not for', '["Embedding multimedia content", "Adding hyperlinks", "Setting background colors and gradients", "Defining semantic document structure", "Displaying text content"]'::jsonb, 3, 'CSS (Cascading Style Sheets) is used for styling such as setting background applying and animations. cannot handle these tasks effectively', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Web Development', NULL, 2604, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
