('alict_02626', 8, 'Web Development', 'What is the result of using underline in CSS?', '["The text will be underlined only", "The text will have both underline and line-through effects", "The text will not have any style applied", "The text will have a double underline", "The text will have a bold effect"]'::jsonb, 2, 'Option 1: This is incorrect because both underline and line-through are explicitly defined. underline line-through hk folu Option 2: The text-decoration property allows multiple values to be combined. When underline applied to the text at the same time. text-decoration', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Web Development', NULL, 2626, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
('alict_02627', 8, 'Web Development', 'Which of the following statements about internal CSS is true?', '["Internal CSS overrides external CSS styles but not inline CSS", "Internal CSS is stored in a separate file with a .css extension", "Internal CSS is linked to an document using the", "Internal CSS is loaded asynchronously for better performance", "Internal CSS is placed within the"]'::jsonb, 5, 'Correct answer: "Internal CSS is placed within the". This follows from standard HTML/CSS behaviour for the tag or property in question.', NULL, NULL, 'medium', 'Web Development', NULL, 2627, 'A/L Past Paper Series'),
